<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though many fail,</l><l>And fall to sin.</l><l>It doesn’t change—</l><l>God’s chosen them.</l><l>We’re not a judge,</l><l>But shepherds true.</l><l>We overcome</l><l>So they can too.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We won’t be swayed</l><l>To love the world.</l><l>Though ev’n betrayed,</l><l>We’ll gain the Lord.</l><l>Restricted now,</l><l>In grace He’ll train,</l><l>The coming age</l><l>With Him to reign.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
